    "article_content_gA8XMg": {
      "type": "article__content",
      "blocks": {
        "image_caption_DKxmM7": {
          "type": "image_caption",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-md",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-0",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-lg",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-0",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "1096px",
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BLOG-BTS-COVER-MOBILE.png",
            "image_desktop": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BLOG-BTS-COVER-DESKTOP.webp",
            "caption": "<p>Add a Blueair air purifier to your back-to-school list<\/p>",
            "caption_style": "p6",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "text_cVppfy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-0",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-xl",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-xl",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-sm",
            "max_width_desktop": "95ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Many dorm rooms have air quality issues because of aging buildings¹ with small, underlid rooms and limited airflow. Because interior living spaces harbor moisture, these features create the perfect breeding ground for mold.<\/p><p>Exposure to mold—a common indoor air pollutant found in dormitories—can cause symptoms such as sneezing, stuffy nose, red or itchy eyes or skin, and chest tightness. These symptoms² can be seasonal or long term and more severe, leading to pneumonia, asthma, and other respiratory infections.<\/p>",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
        "image_text_KwReyX": {
          "type": "image_text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-lg",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-xl",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "120ch",
            "color": "text-blue",
            "title": "Cute and compact",
            "title_style": "h3",
            "richtext": "<p>Don't let its small size fool you – this little air purifier works wonders in even the coziest of dorm rooms.<\/p><p>The Blue Pure 511 was designed to fit in tight spaces. Fresh air, more space, and total comfort are now just a tap away.<\/p>",
            "image_mobile": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BLOG-BTS-BODY1_1.png",
            "image_desktop": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BLOG-BTS-BODY1.webp",
            "image_placement_mobile": "flex-col",
            "image_placement_desktop": "tabletl:flex-row-reverse"
          }
        },
        "image_text_myAfUX": {
          "type": "image_text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-lg",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-xl",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "120ch",
            "color": "text-blue",
            "title": "Quiet Mark certified",
            "title_style": "h3",
            "richtext": "<p>Dorm life can sometimes feel like a never-ending party, with bustling corridors and loud roommates. Amid this chaos, the last thing you need is a noisy appliance adding to the commotion.<\/p><p>Thankfully, our air purifiers are designed to be whisper-quiet, ensuring that you can concentrate on your studies or enjoy a peaceful night's sleep without any disturbances.<\/p>",
            "image_mobile": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BLOG-BTS-BODY2_1.png",
            "image_desktop": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BLOG-BTS-BODY2.png",
            "image_placement_mobile": "flex-col",
            "image_placement_desktop": "tabletl:flex-row-reverse"
          }
        },
        "image_text_4K7yPm": {
          "type": "image_text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-lg",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-xl",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "120ch",
            "color": "text-blue",
            "title": "Quickly cleans stuffy dorm rooms",
            "title_style": "h3",
            "richtext": "<p>If you are someone who constantly suffers from allergies, life in a confined dorm can quickly turn into a nightmare.<\/p><p>Blueair air purifiers remove at least 99.97%* of tiny airborne particles like pollen, dust and mold allergens. No more red eyes or sneezing fits, just pure comfort, and a clear mind for your studies.<\/p>",
            "image_mobile": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BLOG-BTS-BODY3_1.png",
            "image_desktop": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BLOG-BTS-BODY3.png",
            "image_placement_mobile": "flex-col",
            "image_placement_desktop": "tabletl:flex-row-reverse"
          }
        },
        "image_text_tcVA7Q": {
          "type": "image_text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-lg",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-xl",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "120ch",
            "color": "text-blue",
            "title": "Keeps your room stylish",
            "title_style": "h3",
            "richtext": "<p>Choose from a variety of washable Scandinavian-inspired pre-filters. Allowing you to choose the one that best suits your personal style.<\/p>",
            "image_mobile": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BLOG-BTS-BODY4.png",
            "image_desktop": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BLOG-BTS-BODY4_1.png",
            "image_placement_mobile": "flex-col",
            "image_placement_desktop": "tabletl:flex-row-reverse"
          }
        }
      },
